  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have committed a specific story to heart and memory. You dedication this tale has expanded your mastery of it, when you call it forth from the akashic records.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Ability to shape veils, Perform (any) 5 ranks</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose a veil set (ex. Angelic Armaments<sup>Co7SAT</sup> or Spider’s Stories). When you have 3 or more veils from that set shaped, your essence capacity for all veils you have shaped from that set is increased by 1. This does not stack with the feat Enhanced Capacity or other increases to essence capacity not derived from class abilities or veilweaver level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/skinwalker-heritages#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
